d9","logical_entry_identity":"3dfcc7421c27868e34fc11e91a7cd5a26be4c4a9d2d69f9054134004fc76a21e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Attack the target for %d%% Nature weapon damage.\n\t\tIf the attack brings your target below a percent of its max life (based on talent level and relative size) or kills it, you attempt to swallow it, killing it automatically and regaining life and equilibrium depending on its level.\n\t\tThe target may save against your physical power to prevent this attempt.\n\t\tLevels in Swallow raise your Physical and Mental critical rate by %d%%.\n\t\tEach point in sand drake talents increase your physical resistance by 0.5%%.\n\t\tThis talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.\n\t\t\n\t\tMax life threshold at your current size:\n\t\tTiny:  %d%%\n\t\tSmall:  %d%%\n\t\tMedium:  %d%%\n\t\tBig:  %d%%\n\t\tHuge:  %d%%\n\t\tGargantuan:  %d%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"对目标造成 %d%% 自然武器伤害。\n\t\t如果这个攻击将目标的生命值降低到其最大生命值的一定比例以下（基于技能等级和两者体型大小）或杀死了它，你会吞噬它，立刻将其杀死，并根据其等级恢复生命值和失衡值。\n\t\t对方会与你的物理强度进行豁免对抗，以防被吞噬。\n\t\t同时，这个技能还能被动提升你的物理和精神暴击率 %d%%。\n\t\t每点土龙系的天赋可以使你增加物理抗性 0.5%%。\n\t\t如果你装备了盾牌，这一技能也会用你的盾牌攻击。\n\n\t\t基于你目前的体型，吞噬的生命值上限如下所示：\n\t\t微小：%d%%\n\t\t较小：%d%%\n\t\t中等：%d%%\n\t\t较大：%d%%\n\t\t庞大：%d%%\n\t\t巨大：%d%%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e5dbf9c44fdcb0cb38301c1eba9384fb19660f56cbf8d3ea08a75f51eb4a5846","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68a4c971781d6428f0a4fe28ee3a1b2c5acd763a1699ee9c2c753a7b5f969a42","logical_entry_identity":"e9d55e89374b9eb9dfc4a5faf3f5bd3c25e3818bbab8dad102e32376666d3529","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#CRIMSON#Telos's gem seems to flare and glows an unearthly colour.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#CRIMSON#泰勒斯的宝石闪耀着，发出非自然的光辉。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1834de2082ab5cb97976d3fc12e87a25d24abd4d48088b8c0357c3665bb53bbe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"68a89f21b9cfc2f7f8bf08a4bd8cf8eccf01f38463170b388a0e28c5475d6bbe","logical_entry_identity":"f82c99cd