ome.lua","source":"A thought can inspire; a thought can kill. After centuries of oppression, years of imprisonment, a thought shall break us free and vengeance will strike from our darkest dreams.","source_tag":"_t","target":"思想可以鼓舞人，思想也能杀人，在几个世纪的压抑、数年的监禁之后，我们心中的复仇思想会从我们最黑暗的梦境中爆发。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50d9776ed776640da2f021a3698caa991739fcff8cefe069f96893ac551b4fb0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6934ce1917e7d290745ca11ffddec2eca04eed308367e679076a71b360d577f7","logical_entry_identity":"b0ae56db5d40ca8bba08012add4d513fe40b27d747a584b5ce062a78d4efe0ba","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This yeek has all sorts of gems to sell.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这名夺心魔出售所有品种的宝石。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2fea7cba6d5902c29d2cc239a137e10013f5d1adedf07f675ce784f759772c56","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"693c20ff77fed27a6315d1be477fa0db0ae05a8c4701d561707e15c82f2f3007","logical_entry_identity":"5b62f1bb8a8257d77112812b50a51177b8344f414427ee07f23fa02bf780a951","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Explodes knocking the enemy 1 space in a random direction and dealing %d light and %d darkness damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"爆炸将敌人向随机方向击退1格，造成 %d 光系和 %d 暗影伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2e421411c5fcb46dcb39dee8b5a75ecc03af3f8bf9429f19ef2232a6575269ed","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"69413608a76827e7e34d611672087e27b86f3916805d8f1e12eaba6e96ac509a","logical_entry_identity":"3b9b2184d1c8a8c72d9f29e4c6e9aabceb61ca3e77c85a5366fe5f4fdb5c6fa8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Self-Sacrifice","source_tag":"talent name","target":"自我牺牲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b313a3be74259d2d26a4567147c98ee4b5c50920d3f2bd8d8c13afb29d407992","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"694aaf4f6302a39182b555263dbd9103051c87f64a180f595782ea586efd5a63","logical_entry_identity":"ca01a4240bd1b56d6f4e4d011b7bf6cb5d34cede9191c39f7bfb5ffdf7e8f468","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Jus